    "description": "<h2>Outcome and context</h2><p>From the Player prototype&#039;s conditional-status set, Emily asked to keep this simple for now: surface only a Fraud Flag condition and a Primary Email Blank condition, each with a simple banner on the Player record to draw attention. All other prototype conditions are explicitly out of scope at this time.</p><h2>Current state</h2><p>BUILD-175 (WAGR-196) built a Ban Status + Banner pattern on the Player record that this can follow. BUILD-184 (WAGR-195, Fraud Flags Related List) and DECISION-02/03 (WAGR-295, WAGR-1) cover fraud data and the still-open business rule for how fraud affects Player status, but no banner exists yet. No banner exists for a blank Primary Email either, though Primary Email is called out elsewhere (BUILD-173 / WAGR-160) as required before a Sign-Up can be marked Completed.</p><h2>Proposed solution</h2><ol><li><p>Add a banner to the Player record page, shown when the Player has an active/confirmed Fraud Flag.</p></li><li><p>Add a banner shown when Primary Email is blank.</p></li><li><p>Skip every other conditional status shown in the prototype for now, per Emily&#039;s note.</p></li><li><p>Banner wording and severity should follow the same visual pattern as the existing Ban Status banner (BUILD-175) for consistency.</p></li></ol><h2>Acceptance criteria</h2><ol><li><p>A Player with a Fraud Flag shows the fraud banner; one without does not.</p></li><li><p>A Player with a blank Primary Email shows the blank-email banner; one with a value does not.</p></li><li><p>Both banners can display together if both conditions are true.</p></li><li><p>No other prototype condition is built into a banner at this time.</p></li></ol><h2>Dependencies</h2><p>Depends on the Fraud Flag data model (BUILD-184 / WAGR-195, and the still-open business rule in DECISION-02/03 — WAGR-295, WAGR-1) and follows the pattern set by BUILD-175 — Player: Ban Status + Banner (WAGR-196).</p><h2>Source</h2><p>Wagertech Notes / Questions (Emily Vandenberg), Player record doc, reviewed Sep 2026: &quot;From your Player prototype, we would like to implement some of the conditional statuses outlined, can we keep it simple and surface a Fraud Flag + Primary Email Blank, with a simple banner on the Player Record to draw attention to those condition. We can skip the other conditions at this time.&quot; https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mp3b1qpJkzKNDztEQpdnv-BYCgUgDdXe5jLuJi-ix1U/edit?tab=t.0</p>",
