      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "10562",
          "author": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"74416b2d8327\"><span data-local-id=\"dc240c15-f52e-4985-b668-ded078cdd0a5\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"712020:61966a85-61f2-42ce-8382-85568cc7e090\">@Kobi Kunasekaran</span> is this banner meant to catch old, pre-migration records only, or does Emily expect it to catch something that can happen going forward?<br><br>Player Email is a required field so I’m unsure what scenario the Primary Email being blank is accounting for.</p>",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
