            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"c999908edf9b\">Emily has stated it should be two seperate banners with conditions</p>",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "created": "2026-09-17T09:34:27.163-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-17T09:34:27.163-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
        {
          "id": "11262",
          "author": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"d69cc15991af\">Followed up with questions to understand why these are needed;</p><ul data-local-id=\"fbcb90340272\"><li data-local-id=\"604e10d18e4e\"><p data-local-id=\"8471ab13e607\">Primary Email is currently a required field on the Player record, so under normal signup there shouldn&#039;t be a way for it to end up blank. </p><p data-local-id=\"c4dcde4bb794\">Is this banner meant to catch legacy/pre-migration records where the field could be empty, or is there a scenario where a Player could still end up without a Primary Email?</p></li><li data-local-id=\"8a6c1e48df44\"><p data-local-id=\"19bee8470868\"> For Fraud Flagged banner what are you specifically trying to give visibility into; Is it, this player was banned because of fraud, or something like a player under fraud review who hasn&#039;t been banned yet?<br><br></p></li></ul>",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "created": "2026-09-17T12:03:29.922-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-17T12:03:29.922-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
        {
          "id": "11289",
          "author": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"d28d62038750\"><strong>Outcome from Emily&#039;s Sep 22 response:</strong></p><p data-local-id=\"4ce99c01f397\">Primary Email blank banner: holding off. No use case going forward — historical data will be sent clean (primary email populated for each player). Revisit if it becomes a need later.</p><p data-local-id=\"1f3a2e9e19c9\">Fraud Flag banner: not building as a separate banner. Emily confirmed the existing Banned Banner (BUILD-175 / WAGR-196) is sufficient for the banned-for-fraud case — no need to bring back Ban Reason or add fraud-specific banner logic.</p><p data-local-id=\"706de13b023e\">Both banners originally in this ticket&#039;s scope are now cut.</p>",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "accountId": "712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d",
            "emailAddress": "taryn@jumpr.io",
            "displayName": "Taryn Reithofer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Toronto",
            "accountType": "atlassian"
          },
          "created": "2026-09-22T15:45:40.916-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-22T15:45:40.916-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        },
        {
          "id": "11292",
          "author": {
